  "slug": "today-is-my-birthday",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/19529_today-is-my-birthday.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Today is my birthday. The gift I gave myself was a pair of shoes. Those shoes were a bit expensive, but I have liked them for a long time. My friends gave me a bouquet of flowers, a bottle of perfume, and a big cake, which I loved very much. My parents sent me a red envelope with eight hundred yuan in it. I want to use the money to treat my friends to dinner and then go singing. This is my birthday."
  ],
  "english_full": "Today is my birthday. The gift I gave myself was a pair of shoes. Those shoes were a bit expensive, but I have liked them for a long time. My friends gave me a bouquet of flowers, a bottle of perfume, and a big cake, which I loved very much. My parents sent me a red envelope with eight hundred yuan in it. I want to use the money to treat my friends to dinner and then go singing. This is my birthday.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Сего́дня мой день рожде́ния. Пода́рок, который я пода́л / пода́ла себе́, — это па́ра ту́фель. Эти ту́фли были чу́точку дорого́ими, но я подо́бные им очень люби́л / люби́ла долгое вре́мя."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Segod́nya moy deń rozhdeniya. Podaŕok, kotorý ya podaĺ / podalá sebé, — eto pará tuf́el. Éti tuf́li byli chutóchku doroǵoimi, no ya podoĺbným im ocheń lyubiĺ / lyubila dolgoe vreḿya."
  ],
